From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P80 builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Allow ashmem open() for 28.0-30.0 vendors, as for newer ones

Android 17 no longer allows open() on the ashmem device for all domains;
new vendor policies grant it (vendor/ashmem), and the compat files of
31.0 and later add "(allow domain ashmem_libcutils_device (chr_file
(open)))" for older vendors. The 28.0-30.0 compat files restored by
TrebleDroid lack it. On kernels without F_SEAL_FUTURE_WRITE (before 5.1)
libcutils and ART fall back from memfd to ashmem, so on such a vendor
nothing but apps can create shared memory: zygote logs "Unable to open
ashmem device: Permission denied" (Teclast P80, vendor 29.0, kernel 4.9).
---
diff --git a/private/compat/28.0/28.0.compat.cil b/private/compat/28.0/28.0.compat.cil
--- a/private/compat/28.0/28.0.compat.cil
+++ b/private/compat/28.0/28.0.compat.cil
@@ -13,3 +13,7 @@
 (allow mlsvendorcompat app_data_file (file (ioctl read write create getattr setattr lock append map unlink rename open watch watch_reads)))
 (allow mlsvendorcompat privapp_data_file (dir (ioctl read write create getattr setattr lock rename open watch watch_reads add_name remove_name reparent search rmdir)))
 (allow mlsvendorcompat privapp_data_file (file (ioctl read write create getattr setattr lock append map unlink rename open watch watch_reads)))
+
+;; New system images do not allow open() to work on ashmem for all domains,
+;; so add it for compatibility with older vendor images.
+(allow domain ashmem_libcutils_device (chr_file (open)))
diff --git a/private/compat/29.0/29.0.compat.cil b/private/compat/29.0/29.0.compat.cil
--- a/private/compat/29.0/29.0.compat.cil
+++ b/private/compat/29.0/29.0.compat.cil
@@ -36,3 +36,7 @@
 
 (allow vendor_init debugfs_file_type (file (create getattr open read write setattr relabelfrom unlink map)))
 (allow vendor_init debugfs_fs_type (file (open read setattr map)))
+
+;; New system images do not allow open() to work on ashmem for all domains,
+;; so add it for compatibility with older vendor images.
+(allow domain ashmem_libcutils_device (chr_file (open)))
diff --git a/private/compat/30.0/30.0.compat.cil b/private/compat/30.0/30.0.compat.cil
--- a/private/compat/30.0/30.0.compat.cil
+++ b/private/compat/30.0/30.0.compat.cil
@@ -37,3 +37,7 @@
 
 (allow vendor_init debugfs_file_type (file (create getattr open read write setattr relabelfrom unlink map)))
 (allow vendor_init debugfs_fs_type (file (open read setattr map)))
+
+;; New system images do not allow open() to work on ashmem for all domains,
+;; so add it for compatibility with older vendor images.
+(allow domain ashmem_libcutils_device (chr_file (open)))
